[03:03.844]Darkened states ephemeral upon the research grid
[03:27.876]Clad in verglas and rime
[03:31.791]Glacic fabric hugs my contours
[03:35.481]Corporeal I hauled from the dream-state
[03:50.254]Hippocampus thawing / Revival process / Swirl cache sector
[03:55.535]Slipping free from the artificial ice chamber
