[04:15.287]Insatiable magnets of sanguine!
[05:27.513]Crude obsidian gore
[05:50.787]Med-frigate / Biotronic marauders
[06:28.658]Searing over dusk-felled labyrinths and staring into the shallow bore of infinity;
[06:37.940]An opulent sky as a veil over my eyes
[06:41.613]Utter me Åmmon…
